.SH NAME
geni\-uploader\-pguid \- probe the profile\-g URL\-number resolution form (booleans only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B geni\-uploader pguid
.BI "\-\-manifest " "MANIFEST"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read\-only probe of the profile\-g<guid> API form: one paced singular GET per manifest target. Prints per\-target booleans and a RESOLVED\-MAPPED verdict only; identifiers are never printed. See docs/guid\-resolution.md for the resolution mechanism.
